msgstr "У {matching} із {total} рядків немає придатного типу транзакції"

#: /app/src/modules/import/ImportModule.js:1858
msgid ""
"The type column is empty or unrecognized on those rows, so they will be "
"added based on whether the amount is negative. Fill the type in, or check "
"the mapping, if that is not what you want."
